\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. To the Name of our salvation,
\par Laud and honour let us pay,
\par Which for many a generation
\par Hid in God's foreknowledge lay,
\par But with holy exultation
\par We may sing aloud to-day.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus is the Name we treasure,
\par Name beyond what words can tell;
\par Name of gladness, Name of pleasure,
\par Ear and heart delighting well;
\par Name of sweetness passing measure,
\par Saving us from sin and hell.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. 'Tis the Name for adoration,
\par Name for songs of victory,
\par Name for holy meditation
\par In this vale of misery,
\par Name for joyful veneration
\par By the citizens on high.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. 'Tis the Name that whoso preacheth
\par Speaks like music to the ear;
\par Who in prayer this Name beseecheth
\par Sweetest comfort findeth near;
\par Who its perfect wisdom reacheth,
\par Heavenly joy possesseth here.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Jesus is the Name exalted
\par Over every other name,
\par In this Name, whene'er assaulted,
\par We can put our foes to shame:
\par Strength to them who else had halted.
\par Eyes to blind, and feet to lame.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Therefore we in love adoring,
\par This most blessed Name revere,
\par Holy Jesu, Thee imploring
\par So to write it in us here
\par That, hereafter heavenward soaring,
\par We may sing with Angels there.
\par                                         Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

